# Changelog

## v0.1.6 (2026-02-13)

- Add option to show/hide the toolbar for the sphere navigation.

## v0.1.5 (2026-02-06)

- Update to latest dependencies (PhotoSphereViewer 5.15).
- Fix "menu"-key opening a context menu. Opens the application menu now. ([#33](https://github.com/dynobo/sphereview/pull/26))

## v0.1.4 (2025-10-17)

- Update to latest GTK 4.20, Libadwaita 1.8 and PhotoSphereViewer 5.14.
- Improve keyboard shortcut dialog.

## v0.1.3 (2025-07-20)

- Add keyboard shortcuts `+` and `-` for zooming in and out.
- Improve keyboard navigation by maintaining focus on the viewer.
- Remove distracting blue focus outlines from buttons at the bottom.
- Disable unnecessary webkit context menu ([#26](https://github.com/dynobo/sphereview/pull/26) - [vanillajonathan](https://github.com/vanillajonathan) 🚀 ).
- Add debug info to about dialog ([#29](https://github.com/dynobo/sphereview/pull/29) - [vanillajonathan](https://github.com/vanillajonathan) 🚀 ).
- Slightly reword Flathub description and application menu.

## v0.1.2 (2025-07-02)

- Fix opening files of supported MIME types.  
- Remove unnecessary flatpak permission.

## v0.1.1 (2025-07-01)

- Add shortcut to toggle auto rotate.

## v0.1.0 (2025-06-30)

- Initial release.